    "show_share": true,
    "description": "\"The range of investigations and the standard of diagnostic and therapeutic facilities available in the city were upgraded after the establishment of the Aga Khan University Hospital (AKUH) and as a result there has been an all-round improvement in the general medical standards in other private institutions, \" said Dr Faridon Setna, Medical Superintendent of Lady Dufferin Hospital. He was the chief guest at the opening ceremony of AKUH's twenty- sixth Laboratory Specimen Collection Unit at Lady Dufferin Hospital in Karachi. He said that this Laboratory Specimen Collection Unit at Lady Dufferin Hospital is beneficial for the patients of this hospital as well as the local residents.",
